      </details>
      <details class="method-details" open="false">
        <summary>Preprocessing</summary>
        <p>Dropped 11 unnamed/id columns, 2 near-zero-variance variables. Three-tier imputation: median under 10% missing, MICE 10–80%, remaining filled with training-set median. SMOTE only inside CV training folds.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="method-details" open="false">
        <summary>Models</summary>
        <p>Five models: Logistic Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest, XGBoost, LightGBM. Stratified 5-fold CV grouped on subject_id. SMOTE only inside training folds. Final model selection based on test AUROC.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="method-details" open="false">
        <summary>Survival</summary>
        <p>Kaplan-Meier curves, Cox proportional hazards model, Random Survival Forest. C-index reported for both.</p>
